            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Actually, I have a use case.\n\nI want to implement sticky cursor, like in the example here:\nhttps://github.com/jake-stewart/multicursor.nvim/wiki/More-examples#sticky-cursor\n\nFor the implementation, I need to move the cursor with `api.nvim_win_set_cursor()`. Basically, I need a way to move the main cursor while bypassing follow mode.",
